## 🚀 Features

### 1. **Calibrated ML Scoring with Temporary Adjustments** (May 11, 2026)
Post-calibration adjustments to correct systematic biases:
- **Direction bias:** Overs +18pp, Unders -26pp (model overfit to direction)
- **Odds signal:** Long-odds unders penalized -15pp (≥150 odds) or -8pp (≥120)
- **Same-game penalty:** Correlated props from same game -20pp
- **Expected impact:** +60% parlay hit rate improvement (validation in progress)

### 2. **Stat-Specific ML Calibration** (May 10, 2026)
Isotonic regression calibrators trained per stat type:
- 7 calibrators: hits, strikeouts, totalBases, homeRuns, stolenBases, rbi, walks
- Training data: 52,583 resolved legs
- Brier improvement: +16.6% (0.2826 → 0.2341)
- Average prediction: 45.5% (matches actual hit rate)

### 3. **Reliable game_start_time Population** (May 12, 2026) **NEW**
Multi-layer fallback system with type-safe filtering:
- Fail-closed filter: NULL or unparseable times → excluded
- Handles both datetime objects and strings (psycopg2 compatibility)
- 15-minute forward buffer (only games starting >15 min from now)
- Current: 100% of legs have valid game_start_time

### 4. **Hybrid Player ID Resolution** (May 12, 2026) **NEW**
Two-stage resolution for SGO props:
- Primary: Database name→ID mapping (O(1) lookup, 95%+ coverage)
- Fallback: statsapi.lookup_player() for new players only
- Current: 25/25 props resolved per run (0 API calls needed)

### 5. **coverage_overall Persistence Fix** (May 12, 2026) **NEW**
Fixed 100% NULL issue:
- Root cause: db.py INSERT missing coverage_overall in column list
- Fix: Added to INSERT + ON CONFLICT backfill
- Current: 96.8% populated (333/344 legs)
- Historical gap: May 5-11 (~1,820 legs) remain NULL permanently (accepted)

### 6. **Pitcher Data Infrastructure** (May 12, 2026) **NEW**
13 new columns added to support pitcher-aware matchup logic:
- **Coverage signals:** coverage_overall, coverage_vs_hand, coverage_recent_10, coverage_recent_5
- **Pitcher identification:** pitcher_id, pitcher_name, pitcher_team
- **Pitcher stats:** pitcher_era, pitcher_k9, pitcher_whip
- **Batter data:** batter_hand, pitcher_hand, pitcher_vs_batter_hand_era
- Current: 27% populated (infrastructure complete, 100% expected tomorrow)

### 7. **Regenerate Button with Fresh Odds** (May 12, 2026) **NEW**
Complete overhaul for genuine fresh data:
- **Before:** Loaded stale DB legs, returned same 2 parlays every time
- **After:** Triggers run_targeted_pipeline() → fetches fresh SGO odds → different parlays
- **UX:** Polling UI with "Regenerating Recommendations..." spinner
- **Auto-refresh:** Polls every 2s, updates UI when complete (~25s runtime)
- **Status:** Fully operational with professional UX

### 8. **Manual Pipeline Trigger** (May 12, 2026) **NEW**
On-demand pipeline execution for testing:
```bash
curl -X POST https://mlb-agent.up.railway.app/api/admin/run_pipeline \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer MLBparlays"
```
- Runs run_targeted_pipeline(source="manual") in background thread
- Returns immediately, logs to Railway
- Use case: Immediate validation after deployments

### 9. **V2 Normalized Schema** (May 7-12, 2026)
Single parlay schema with per-leg outcome tracking:
- ✅ 50 v1 parlays migrated to v2 (May 12)
- ✅ Dashboard queries v2 exclusively (2x faster)
- ✅ V1 tables deprecated (safe to drop after June 11)
- ✅ Per-leg tracking enables advanced analytics

### 10. **Pitcher-Aware Matchup Logic**
- Batter coverage split by opposing pitcher handedness (RHP vs LHP)
- Pitcher ERA/K9/WHIP rankings integrated
- Prop-type routing (hits vs strikeouts)
- **Status:** Infrastructure complete, Phase 3 wiring in progress

### 11. **Three Daily Pipeline Runs**
- **9:00 AM ET:** Resolution + full fetch + scoring + building
- **12:00 PM ET:** Odds refresh + lineup checks + rebuild
- **5:30 PM ET:** Final odds + adjustments

### 12. **Web Dashboard (4 Tabs)**
- **Legs:** Browse scored props with filters (shows adjusted scores)
- **Dashboard:** Performance analytics (v2 parlays only)
- **Training:** ML data quality monitoring (90K+ samples)
- **Picks:** Daily recommendations with regenerate button + polling UI

### 13. **Quality Validation Monitoring**
- Real-time quality checks (top 20 vs top 50 legs)
- Automatic logging of quality drop percentage
- Warning alerts if degradation exceeds 10%

