```bash
# Check Railway logs after clicking button
grep "regenerate" railway.log

# Expected output:
[regenerate] Loaded 88 upcoming legs
[regenerate] Fetching fresh SGO odds for 25 players...
[regenerate] Updated odds for 25/25 legs (100%)
[regenerate] Building parlays from 88 eligible legs...
[regenerate] Built 2 parlays
[regenerate] Pipeline completed successfully
```

### **Database Health Check**
```sql
-- Run in Supabase SQL Editor

-- Check coverage_overall and pitcher data population
SELECT 
    run_date,
    COUNT(*) as total_legs,
    COUNT(coverage_overall) as have_coverage,
    COUNT(pitcher_id) as have_pitcher,
    COUNT(game_start_time) as have_time
FROM mlb_scored_legs
WHERE run_date >= (CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '3 days')::text
GROUP BY run_date
ORDER BY run_date DESC;

-- Should return: coverage ~97-100%, pitcher ~30-100%, time 100%
```

